  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lot 1: Supply, Delivery, Installation, Testing, Maintenance, Training and After-Sales Service of IT and Related Equipment to ECOWAS Maritime Centres and ECOWAS Multinational Maritime Coordination Centres</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Indirect Management with ECOWAS - Supply contracts (activity 2.6.2) - The action will aim to fill the gaps in provision of equipment to meet local needs associated with the Yaounde architecture. This will be limited to urgently-needed equipment in national operational centres (MOCs), zonal MMCCCs or regional (CRESMAO). This particular contract is for Lot 1 - IT and Related Equipment&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
